# YM-02A requires no environment variables or credentials.
# VITE_* values are public browser-bundle configuration, never secrets.
# Future provider credentials belong exclusively in the server environment.

# YM-02B also requires no environment variables; local API port is 8787.

# Public HTTPS origin only (optional). Empty native builds are offline samples.
# Never put provider/Supabase privileged keys here; VITE_* is bundled publicly.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-approved-api.example
